  "details": "This module adds a \"Generate internal links\" action to the AI CKEditor toolbar, letting editors select text and have the module search the site's content for relevant pages to link to.\n\nThe module's search query did not respect entity access when returning results to the browser.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an user must have permission to use the AI CKEditor \"Generate internal links\" feature on a text format.",
